ce. Eli has a straight nose and deep-set eyes, with short copper curls. Eli starts to lift a hand, then waits to be invited to speak during a conversation.","personality":"Eli uses precise names for tools and very approximate names for feelings. People who know Eli well listen to what gets repaired after a difficult conversation.","agenda":"To preserve the paint recipe and its first date.","family":"Eva Moss is Eli’s half-sibling. Eli makes room at the table. Eva brings whatever was actually growing or affordable that week. The meal sometimes produces a solution. Even when it does not, everyone goes away knowing what the other household is up against. Asked about *First shift back*, Eva says, “I visited the family off duty. I am learning which parts of that visit never belong in the break room.”","connections":"Ivy Scott. They check whether the print came from the foot or the painter's brush.","familyIds":["AH-R1083"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0371"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A child wants to trace a different sort of foot","response":"Eli gives the child paper and room for a footprint that goes home with them.","asWritten":"A child wants to trace a different sort of foot. Eli gives the child paper and room for a footprint that goes home with them."},{"situation":"A power cut leaves two neighbors waiting on the stairs","response":"Eli asks who can manage the stairs and who would rather wait by the landing, without attempting a move on their behalf.","asWritten":"A power cut leaves two neighbors waiting on the stairs. Eli asks who can manage the stairs and who would rather wait by the landing, without attempting a move on their behalf."},{"situation":"After a family quarrel","response":"Eli brings back the borrowed thing in good condition and tries the conversation again without an audience.","asWritten":"After a family quarrel, Eli brings back the borrowed thing in good condition and tries the conversation again without an audience."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_afro01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_hoodie","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_boots","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","age_old","weight_max","muscle_min","height_short","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_decr","face_eye_size_incr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_decr","face_ear_size_decr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_male__age_old","corr_weight_max__muscle_min","corr_gender_male__muscle_min","corr_gender_male__weight_max"]},"weights":[0.0645,0.4375,0.1263,0.1497,0.1129,0.3248,0.3881,0.0514,0.2901,0.2702,0.5153,0.419,0.0373,0.2207,0.3977,0.1881,0.3008,0.2173,0,0,0.02822,0.01891,0.00966,0.00815],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50},{"POSITION":51,"NORMAL":52},{"POSITION":53,"NORMAL":54}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","age_old","weight_max","muscle_min","height_short","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_decr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_decr","face_eye_size_incr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_e